<p>Bole sajjad kya gham uthaae pyaari behna<br />
Bhai aur tera laasha uthaae pyaari behna</p>

<p>Hai andhere me bibi ki mayyat, waae ghurbat <br />
Shamma koun aake is jaa jalaaye pyaari behna</p>

<p>Hathkadi haath me hai hamaare, bas nahi hai<br />
