<p>Bhai ke haath me bediyaa'n hai, Zoaf bhi hai<br />
kis tarah ab janaza uthaaye pyaari behna</p>

<p>Kab se mayyat tumhaari padi hai, bekasi hai<br />
dafn ke izn dekhe'n kab aaye pyaari behna</p>

